  "schema": "fsmgen.language_coordination_source_admission.v1",
  "scope": "Inactive preinitialized empty stores and the current Perl inspect_store transaction. The Python peer implements only the checked empty-store coordination protocol. These workers do not publish images, compile, launch a native proxy, query a collector or use the live canonical store. Cooperative serialization does not establish protection against arbitrary noncooperating writers. Controlled lock replacement is a rejecting fault, never a normal repair. Exec probes run before lock acquisition; no worker spawns while it holds coordination. Worker-local clocks and controller clocks remain separate.",
